---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
---
<Layout title="Kent Timothy Limanza — Résumé / Pixelsmith" description="Designer and creative technologist working across interaction design, prototyping, 3D, and physical spaces.">
  <Header />
  <main id="main" class="resume-page wrap">
    <div class="resume-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow mono">THE SLIGHTLY MORE FORMAL VERSION</p><h1>Kent Timothy<br />Limanza<span class="cobalt">.</span></h1><p class="resume-title">Designer & creative technologist</p></div><button class="button button-outline" id="print-resume" hidden>Print / save PDF <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button></div>
    <p class="resume-summary">I connect interaction design, spatial thinking, and creative technology to make experiences people can take part in. My work spans interactive prototypes, microsites, 3D imagery, and exhibition environments. Recent development centres on UX decisions, system planning, and AI-assisted implementation.</p>
    <div class="resume-columns"><div><section><h2>Experience</h2><div class="resume-entry"><p class="mono">DECEMBER 2024–PRESENT</p><h3>Off the Beaten Track</h3><p class="resume-position">Multimedia designer / developer</p><ul><li>Contribute concepts, journeys, wireframes, and interactive applications for events and exhibitions.</li><li>Create 3D spatial layouts and renders, coordinate with builders, and adapt layouts on site.</li><li>Refine touch, camera, and physical-input interactions, multilingual flows, and kiosk operation.</li><li>Collaborate with visual designers and integration teams; prepare troubleshooting guidance and provide on-site support.</li></ul></div><div class="resume-entry"><p class="mono">AUGUST–OCTOBER 2024</p><h3>Picup Media</h3><p class="resume-position">UI/UX designer</p></div><div class="resume-entry"><p class="mono">MAY–JULY 2023</p><h3>Design Incubation Centre</h3><p class="resume-position">Creative developer & product design intern</p><p>Developed a cross-platform Flutter app and p5.js games for Lee Kong Chian Natural History Museum.</p></div></section><section><h2>Education</h2><h3>National University of Singapore</h3><p>Industrial Design · 2020–2024<br />Minor in Interactive Media</p></section></div><div><section><h2>Ways I contribute</h2><h3>Design & making</h3><p>Interaction design, user journeys, wireframing, interactive prototyping, spatial planning, 3D modelling, rendering, and animation.</p><h3>Tools used in projects</h3><p>Figma, Blender, Rhino, Gaea, JavaScript/TypeScript, React/Next.js, p5.js, Pixi.js, MediaPipe, and Arduino/browser serial integration.</p><p class="resume-small">Project experience, not a claim of equal proficiency across all tools.</p></section><section><h2>Explore the work</h2><a class="resume-project" href="/work/galilean-mission/">Galilean Mission <span>↗</span><small>Spatial design, 3D & interaction refinement</small></a><a class="resume-project" href="/work/hawker-colours/">Hawker Colours <span>↗</span><small>Frontend & interactive editorial implementation</small></a><a class="resume-project" href="/work/ccd-thank-you/">CCD Thank You <span>↗</span><small>UX refinement, prototyping & system planning</small></a></section><section><h2>Connect</h2><a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/kent12t">github.com/kent12t ↗</a></section></div></div>
  </main>
  <footer class="site-footer wrap"><a class="footer-brand" href="/">pixelsmith<span class="cobalt">.</span></a><a class="text-link" href="/#work">Back to the work ↗</a></footer>
</Layout>
<script>
  const printButton = document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('#print-resume');
  if (printButton) {
    printButton.hidden = false;
    printButton.addEventListener('click', () => window.print());
  }
</script>
